I also discovered this. I would say it is a bug and someone should file 
it as such. (someone with more time on their hands than me preferably)

I found several ways of getting items out of pits while flying.

1:
  Dig into the pit. Some of the items will fall through the hole and you 
          can then pick up the rest.

2:
  Get someone else to pick them up for you, ait for them to get out of 
the pit and then kill them. (hazardous for sertain items)

3:
  (z)ap a wand of teleportation downwards. The items will all exit the 
pit but you will have to search the entire level for them.

I tried using a bullwhip in wizard mode, but without any success.

As for the most-used method, I usually get someone else to pick up stuff 
in pits and try not to let stuff fall into pits when playing as a vampire.

Ideally, flying creatures should be able to fly down into the pit to 
pick up stuff.

